# Cabeçalhos HTTP — plpcjf.org (Cloudflare Pages)

Copie para `_headers` na raiz do artefato de deploy (`build/web/` inclui `web/_headers`).

## COOP / COEP (D6)

Necessários para `SharedArrayBuffer` e performance WASM do pdfrx:

```
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
```

Alternativa se recursos third-party quebrarem: `Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless`.

## Service worker

```
/flutter_service_worker.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
```

## CORS (API)

O frontend em `https://plpcjf.org` consome a API em `https://plpcg.com`.
CORS está configurado no worker `workers/plpcg-catalog` (`Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://plpcjf.org`).
